    "identifier": "dancing-fools-dance",
    "description": "<p>You swing your weapon in a wide arc striking all creatures in the arc. Make a melee taijutsu Attack, comparing the result against each creature of your choice AC, within your weapons range. On a hit, you deal your [Weapons damage] + 2d4.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creatures must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save they are knocked Prone.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 2d4.</p>",
